WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.208
LOOK. Red circles and blue squares lie mixed together.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.443
SORT COLOUR. Put red pieces in one group and blue in another.

00:00:08.283 --> 00:00:11.121
SORT SHAPE. Make a new circle group and square group.

00:00:12.283 --> 00:00:15.718
EXPLAIN. The same items can be grouped using different features.
